      <description><![CDATA[<ul>
<li>ParaAir now updates itself. Before installing an update it ejects its drives; files waiting to upload stay on your Mac and upload afterwards.</li>
<li>Connect Cloudflare R2 with an R2 API token, from any Cloudflare account.</li>
<li>A new look that matches paraair.pages.dev, with clearer text in Light mode.</li>
<li>Opening ParaAir from the disk image moves it to Applications, and it opens at login.</li>
<li>The version, with its alpha number, is in Advanced and About ParaAir.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
